{
  "key": 43858,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "The Great Marsh is vast!\n",
        "How vast is it, you ask?\r",
        "Take a look from the Observatory\n",
        "and you can see for yourself!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Pastoria’s Great Marsh was once\n",
        "a part of the sea.\r",
        "The seawater drained slowly away over\n",
        "time, leaving the huge marshland.\r",
        "That’s why they say there are rare\n",
        "Pokémon that you can only see here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to battle with me?\n",
        "As a memento of your visit to Pastoria?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll let you join my fan club if you can\n",
        "beat me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re not interested in Idols?\n",
        "...I think I’m going to cry."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, that’s me and my Pokémon!\n",
        "I hope you’ll support us!\r",
        "Just so you know, our latest single is\n",
        "titled “Jigglin’ Pokémon Wub”!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Are we all ready to have some fun?\n",
        "Our battle will be fun! OK?!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, how shall we do this?\n",
        "Shall we do something fantastical?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, how shall I say this...?\n",
        "It makes me all lonely, I say..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, let’s see!\n",
        "Which town will we go to next?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Come on, let’s show off our Pokémon!\n",
        "Let’s do battle, kiddo!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Your spirit’s vibes...\n",
        "You’ve got rock in your veins!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "My guitar...\n",
        "It lies broken and weeping..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000134_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Rock is about your spirit!\n",
        "Battling is about spirit, too!\f",
        "That’s why a battle is rock!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2BriefLookerSite",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: A live Eclipse site.\n",
        "The caves on Route 213.\r",
        "Tonight, we see it with our own\n",
        "eyes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2BriefLookerTwo",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Two go in. Me, and the quiet\n",
        "one.\r",
        "Five is not a raid. Five is a\n",
        "parade."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2BriefRuth",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Cyrus and I will wait at the\n",
        "cave mouth with the readings."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2BriefGarius",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: I'll watch the gate.\n",
        "If they run, they run past me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2RowanSilence",
      "en_US": "Rowan: ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2RowanBelieved",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Since that night in Jubilife,\n",
        "I've believed it could be done.\r",
        "That someone could come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2RowanNotLikeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Not like this.\r",
        "Never like this.\r",
        "And I'll call the station in the\n",
        "morning. I owe them a retraction."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2RowanLab",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Looker. Whatever you need\n",
        "from my lab, it's yours."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2Photos",
      "en_US": [
        "Photographs cover the table.\n",
        "Machine parts. Two bolted frames.\r",
        "In the last one, a rift hangs open\n",
        "where a Lapras should be."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2LookerAfter",
      "en_US": "Looker: ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2RowanFile",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Looker sent me his file on\n",
        "Cyrus.\r",
        "No record. Anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2RowanKeepEye",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: I gave that man a Pok\u00e9mon.\r",
        "...Keep an eye on him for me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PastoriaPC_Text_Arc2RowanResonator",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan taps the Calm Shard set in\n",
        "the Resonator.\r",
        "Rowan: And this. Given freely.\r",
        "There was always another way to\n",
        "that power.\r",
        "They chose this one."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
